flowchart LR
    U[User asks about a condition, symptom, or treatment] --> G{Intent and safety check}
    G -->|Supported search| S[Resolve condition scope with terms and synonyms]
    G -->|Urgent, personal, incomplete, or out of scope| H[Give a safe response or ask for more detail]
    S --> D{Is the scope clear?}
    D -->|No| C[Show possible scopes or ask a clarifying question]
    C --> U
    D -->|Yes| R[Retrieve matching records]

    CM[(Condition names and synonyms)] -. supports .-> S
    SP[(Structured standard procedure records)] --> R
    ET[(Emerging treatment records and sources)] --> R
    R --> V[Check relevance, source, study scope, and status]
    V --> O[Assemble a consistent briefing]
    O --> P[Standard care overview]
    O --> E[Emerging treatment table, organizations, and sources]
    P --> UO[Briefing shown to user]
    E --> UO
    UO --> F[Follow-up question about a treatment]
    F --> TD[(Approved treatment detail, if available)]
    F -->|If no approved detail| SUM[Return sourced catalog summary]
    TD --> UO
    SUM --> UO

    GOV[Clinical and research owners review content and sources] -. maintain .-> SP
    GOV -. maintain .-> ET

    classDef safety fill:#fff4e5,stroke:#d0a658,color:#59441f;
    class G,H,C safety;
